Package: wsiTools
Title: Tools for Reading, Tiling, Converting and Exporting Whole-Slide Images
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Stefano", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com")
Description: An R toolkit for memory-efficient whole-slide image access
    and preprocessing through region-based reading, tiling, pyramidal image
    handling, conversion and export. The package provides backend capability
    checks and abstractions for OpenSlide, libvips, and future microscopy
    backends without loading complete whole-slide images into R memory by
    default.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    magick,
    rmarkdown,
    sf,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: None required for installation. Optional runtime tools:
    OpenSlide command-line tools; libvips command-line tools; Bio-Formats
    command-line tools.
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
